==Battleground==
*8 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mistress Celeboodle]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Commander Ostromeda]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
**20 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
**4 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

